WEBVTT

00:00:00.722 --> 00:00:03.092
An issue needs more than attention.

00:00:03.301 --> 00:00:05.708
It needs a clear next step.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:07.636
Start in My Sundae.

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:10.362
This demonstration flags voids,

00:00:10.572 --> 00:00:13.286
discounts and refunds above normal.

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:15.435
The amount shown is an estimate.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:19.464
Open View source to follow the issue into
its existing tracked

00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:22.805
action. The panel brings together what
happened,

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:26.144
the recommended response and the completion
window.

00:00:26.428 --> 00:00:28.711
Scroll to Owner and timing.

00:00:28.957 --> 00:00:32.457
Responsibility and the due date are visible
together.

00:00:32.912 --> 00:00:37.075
After the work, use the action to record
what changed.

00:00:37.357 --> 00:00:39.813
Then return here to review the outcome.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:41.200
Sundae.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.600
See every layer, act in time.
